{"id":"8e2ae868c0cc48ee","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-continuous-filtering-classification.md","title":"Theorem — Geometric Morphisms Classified by Continuous Filtering Functors","display":"Theorem — Geometric Morphisms Classified by Continuous Filtering Functors","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-continuous-filtering-classification","aliases":["14-thm-continuous-filtering-classification"],"display":"Theorem — Geometric Morphisms Classified by Continuous Filtering Functors","depends_on":["[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor]]","[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","source_locator":"VII.7 Theorem 2、Lemma 3、Corollary 4，印刷页 392–394；VII.9 Theorem 1、Corollary 2，印刷页 399–407；DjVu 第 202–203、205–209 图页"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-continuous-filtering-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-continuous-filtering-classification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Geometric Morphisms Classified by Continuous Filtering Functors"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d70b287bd93237ef\" href=\"?note=d70b287bd93237ef\" title=\"14-df-filtering-topos-functor\">14-df-filtering-topos-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"VII.7 Theorem 2、Lemma 3、Corollary 4，印刷页 392–394；VII.9 Theorem 1、Corollary 2，印刷页 399–407；DjVu 第 202–203、205–209 图页"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小的初等拓扑斯，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小图都有余极限。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,\\eta)\">\\((a,\\eta)\\)</span> 是层化函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是 Yoneda 嵌入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_0=a\\circ y:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(j_0=a\\circ y:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为协变函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(f,g:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为几何态射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{f,g}\">\\(\\rho_{f,g}\\)</span> 的源靶是下式两个函子范畴的 Hom 集。右 whiskering 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a>。本条的“continuous filtering”专指 filtering 与所写覆盖联合满态条件的合取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFiltering}(A,\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFilteringToposFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\{A(u)\\mid u\\in S\\},A(C)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFiltering}(A,\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists f\\ \\exists\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,A,f^*\\circ j_0)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\to\\mathrm{IsContinuousFiltering}(f^*\\circ j_0,\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal E),\\\\\n\\rho_{f,g}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathcal E)}(f^*,g^*)\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)}(f^*\\circ j_0,g^*\\circ j_0),\\\\\n\\rho_{f,g}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta j_0,\\qquad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)}(f^*\\circ j_0,g^*\\circ j_0)\\ \\exists!\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathcal E)}(f^*,g^*)\\ (\\rho_{f,g}(\\theta)=\\alpha).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFiltering}(A,\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFilteringToposFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\\n\\mathrm{IsJointlyEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(\\{A(u)\\mid u\\in S\\},A(C)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFiltering}(A,\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists f\\ \\exists\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,A,f^*\\circ j_0)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\to\\mathrm{IsContinuousFiltering}(f^*\\circ j_0,\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal E),\\\\\n\\rho_{f,g}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathcal E)}(f^*,g^*)\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)}(f^*\\circ j_0,g^*\\circ j_0),\\\\\n\\rho_{f,g}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta j_0,\\qquad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)}(f^*\\circ j_0,g^*\\circ j_0)\\ \\exists!\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathcal E)}(f^*,g^*)\\ (\\rho_{f,g}(\\theta)=\\alpha).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书定位：VII.7 Theorem 2、Lemma 3、Corollary 4，印刷页 392–394；VII.9 Theorem 1、Corollary 2，印刷页 399–407；DjVu 第 202–203、205–209 图页。</p>\n<p>原书 VII.7 把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A\">\\(R\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A\\)</span> 构造为两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小余积间箭头的余等化子，并证明其右伴随是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\mapsto\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(C),-)\">\\(C\\mapsto\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A(C),-)\\)</span>；局部小性使它为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-集合值预层。VII.8 把 filtering 条件改写为沿联合满态族局部提升的条件；VII.9 Theorem 1 用这些条件证明张量保终对象和拉回，故给出到预层拓扑斯的几何态射。覆盖联合满态条件使它经层子拓扑斯因子化，得到前两项。对自然变换，先由表示预层的余极限表达逐分量延拓；所有层又是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ay(C)\">\\(ay(C)\\)</span> 的小余极限，逆像函子保余极限，所以该延拓唯一，给出所写限制映射的双射。这是本书范畴等价的对象与箭头部分，不引入没有定义的“几何态射范畴”符号。本条已读原书陈述、构造与证明主线；VII.9 的长篇局部提升证明未在此独立逐式重证，未作机器验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-filtering-topos-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70b287bd93237ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-topos-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"tar